    "description": "<p>You implant a pervasive amnesia into the natural world of a region up to 1 mile across. For 8 hours, beasts cannot form new memories of your presence or the presence of any creature you designate. Druids who attempt to commune with nature in this region must succeed on a DC 18 Wisdom save or receive only silence. Plants grow slightly toward you.</p>",
